  "sdo:description": "The German research vessels SONNE, METEOR (IV – will enter into service in 2026), ALKOR, and MARIA S. MERIAN support marine research in all ocean regions and are equipped for investigations in the fields of biology, geology, geophysics, glaciology, geochemistry, oceanography, and meteorology. Research conducted using these vessels contribute to the challenges of the Ocean Decade and contributes to its objectives to identify, generate and use critical ocean knowledge to manage the ocean sustainably. They form an important infrastructure and provide researchers from Germany and abroad access to all ocean regions to help them tackle societal challenges.",
